	<title>International Securities Identification Number (ISIN) - Data Services</title>
	<meta name="description" content="An international securities identification number (ISIN) is a 12-digit code that is used to uniquely identify a security’s issue e.g. shares, bonds, etc. This is currently the main method of securities identification worldwide." />
